<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 1.372 off UK's FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 1.372 off UK's FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International Ltd said the following FTSE 100 index stocks trading ex-dividend on Monday take 1.372 points off the index today.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>    * Blue Circle Industries		4.25  5.313  0.230</p>
<p>    * Hanson				    3.00  3.750  1.142</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
